Addendum: Methodology and Prompt Attributions
-----------------------------------------------

The `hallucination_2026/` benchmark adapts the answerer system prompt, four-class grading rubric (`CORRECT`, `INCORRECT`, `PARTIAL_ANSWER`, `NOT_ATTEMPTED`), and Omniscience Index formulation from:

- Artificial Analysis Team (2025), "AA-Omniscience: Evaluating Cross-Domain Knowledge Reliability in Large Language Models", arXiv:2511.13029 (CC BY 4.0)
- `ArtificialAnalysis/AA-Omniscience-Public` dataset card (https://huggingface.co/datasets/ArtificialAnalysis/AA-Omniscience-Public), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

No questions, answers, or API outputs from AA-Omniscience are redistributed in this repository.

